# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GolfVR (Alumni-Weekend-2026/GolfVR/GolfVR)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Per-machine copy of the SteamVR input bindings, written by SteamVR's binding UI.
# The real, committed bindings live in Assets/StreamingAssets/SteamVR/.
Alumni-Weekend-2026/GolfVR/GolfVR/SteamVR_SteamVR_*/

# Asset Store pack content that no GolfVR scene uses. Found by following GUID
# references (scene -> prefab -> material -> texture, plus FBX .meta material remaps)
# out from every scene in Assets/Scenes. ~870 MB. The rest of each pack IS used and
# stays tracked. If you start using something from one of these folders, delete its
# line here and commit it, or it will be missing for everyone else.
Alumni-Weekend-2026/GolfVR/GolfVR/Assets/Survival?Props/textures/
Alumni-Weekend-2026/GolfVR/GolfVR/Assets/Survival?Props/textures.meta
Alumni-Weekend-2026/GolfVR/GolfVR/Assets/FlipGameDev/Terrain&GrassPack/Art/Textures/Terrain_Textures/
Alumni-Weekend-2026/GolfVR/GolfVR/Assets/FlipGameDev/Terrain&GrassPack/Art/Textures/Terrain_Textures.meta
Alumni-Weekend-2026/GolfVR/GolfVR/Assets/FlipGameDev/Terrain&GrassPack/Terrain_Settings/
Alumni-Weekend-2026/GolfVR/GolfVR/Assets/FlipGameDev/Terrain&GrassPack/Terrain_Settings.meta
Alumni-Weekend-2026/GolfVR/GolfVR/Assets/FlipGameDev/Terrain&GrassPack/Demo/
Alumni-Weekend-2026/GolfVR/GolfVR/Assets/FlipGameDev/Terrain&GrassPack/Demo.meta
Alumni-Weekend-2026/GolfVR/GolfVR/Assets/Fantasy?Skybox?FREE/Scenes/
